experiment-repo owns brief, assignment, generation, provenance, numerical results, fit, uncertainty, and diagnostics. figtab-repo owns the final log-log figure and table formatting. paper-repo owns the one-page report and integration. internal-review-repo independently checks compliance and claims. Experiment owns computational feasibility. Full results and diagnostics are now supplied in results/; all objective requirements for simulation and inference have been completed. The primary paired-bootstrap and conventional t intervals both include -1/2. Figure and report delivery remain with their assigned owners.
